"""llmtop — realtime memory/swap monitor for MLX & local LLM workloads on Apple Silicon.

Run:
    ./llmtop                          # live TUI, default filters
    ./llmtop -i 0.5                   # 0.5s refresh
    ./llmtop -m ollama -m llama       # custom process filters
    ./llmtop --log run.csv            # also append CSV
    ./llmtop --jsonl run.jsonl        # also append JSONL
    ./llmtop --no-tui --log run.csv   # headless logger
    ./llmtop --once                   # one sample as JSON to stdout, then exit
    ./llmtop --alert-swap-mb 1000     # macOS notification at 1GB swap used
    ./llmtop --alert-swap-rate 100    # notify on sustained swapout pages/s
    ./llmtop --alert-pressure         # notify on Warning/Critical transitions
    ./llmtop --pane procs             # show only the matching-processes pane
    ./llmtop --pane system --pane models  # show only those two panes
"""
